            "review_title": "Review at Wknd",
            "review_text": "Sahana Ramegowda\nMuscat, Oman25 contributions\n0\nAVOID.\nJan 2026 • Family\n“But we sharpen our knives once a month!” - the strange response of the staff on telling them that their cutlery knife does not even cut their own bread!! \n\nThe dukkah, pea spread on an oldish haggard bread- can make anyone see RED! \nBread comes warm and the spread on it comes ice-cold. So is this a hot breakfast or a cold one? Ur guess is as good as mine. \n\nAnd the woe-ish dessert. We ordered lemon olive oil dessert bake. We received highly sour+ highly sugary substance presented in a rectangle, as a cake. \n\nAfter wasting food, informing the hosts about our disappointments, we left. \n\nNever to go again.\nRead more\nWritten January 16, 2026",
